<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ROMA NAME ZEMAN AS NEW COACH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMA NAME ZEMAN AS NEW COACH.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech coach Zdenek Zeman, sacked earlier this year by Italian serie A side Lazio, will coach city rivals Roma next season, the club said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Stop-gap trainer Nils Liedholm announced the coup, which will bring Zeman back to Rome's Olympic Stadium -- the ground the two teams share -- in a move that could enrage Lazio fans still smarting from his sacking in January.</p>
</text>
